WEBVTT

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.360
Everyone, to the shore!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.660
Mr. Manji...

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.240
Hold on, what?!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.720
On your feet, quickly.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:06.600
Follow me, don't fall behind.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.110
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.580
One two three

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.870
Undead tree

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.290
What truth

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.960
I'll come true

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:37.130
Wow...

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.010
I see that bright light

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:47.390
This is all I have

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.900
What did you say?
I know

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:56.450
Why do you say?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:02.120
Hone the blade lie around

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:08.830
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:13.170
I got lost
I was lost

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.920
Survive of vision

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:20.220
Unfinished heaven

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:23.970
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.730
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.520
Survive of vision

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.660
Kagehisa...

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.880
Rin, you...!
What did you come down here for, you idiot?

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.930
You are truly unbelievable...

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:06.430
I've fled from you countless times,

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.850
but I finally understand.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:13.480
It's a terribly frustrating thing to be run away from...

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.980
As long as you understand...

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.740
Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.370
Mister Habaki.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.040
We truly intended to go on evading you just as we have.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.460
Run and run,

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.000
and raise children of our own in the town where we
finally land.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.170
Teach those children the ways of the sword,

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.970
until we again became a threat.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.390
That's what we thought...

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:49.060
But it seems there is yet unfinished business for us in
these lands.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.560
Kagimura Habaki,

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.520
today is the day I kill you.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.400
I see you are eager to wear the mask of the victim.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.690
Arashino.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:03.490
You shall slay the Killer of 100 and the girl with the
braids.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.870
If those are your orders.

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:08.700
Mitake, Doma, Tarieshin.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.710
You and the Hebi Squad shall slay that woman there.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.000
And Kagehisa Anotsu...

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:20.880
I will butcher you with my entire being.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:23.970
Very well.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.260
Come, then.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.310
Manji.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:35.440
The resentment I bear for you would not be quelled by
an entire night of treatise.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.440
Don't die until you've heard all of it.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.860
Worry about yourself, slant-eyes.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.170
Father...

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.840
Father...

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:15.850
Hey.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.860
Are you alright?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.400
You're...

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.990
Leave me. I cannot bear your pity.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.260
Mister Taito Magatsu...

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.630
What is it?

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.640
If we both live through this,

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.430
teach me the sword.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.600
I want to become stronger.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.480
I can't promise that. One of us will have to die.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.320
That's the nature of this journey.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.440
That is true.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:05.400
I overstepped.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.530
Then...

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.040
if we are ever reborn...

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:36.770
I've underestimated you.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:55.080
Do not think me the same as other enemies you've faced,

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.660
Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:09.470
Wasn't your sword style one of victory by use of a
strange weapon?

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:12.140
You excel even in misunderstandings.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.680
The creed of the Itto-ryu

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.140
is to win by all that you are.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.640
Nothing more than that.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:28.820
Good grief. And here I thought the only scary ones
were Habaki, Anotsu and that girl.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.100
Demon...

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.100
If only for one moment.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.020
Like back then.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:11.700
Is this...?

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.320
Gunpowder, oil.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.910
Stay alive, Mr. Manji!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.790
Did he get him?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.460
Come, Tarieshin.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.840
Whether she's dead or half dead,

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.260
we will finish her.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.330
What was that about?!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.970
A single human

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.350
has never lasted this long against me.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:22.930
That so? I'd say this is pretty typical for me.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:25.810
By the way, I have to thank you.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.690
Don't play dumb.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:32.110
I was worried about whether your metal slab

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.240
would turn towards Rin.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.200
I...

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.370
I am confident in my victory in this fight,

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:45.210
but I do not take you so lightly to believe I could avert my
gaze and yet win.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.000
If that's the case, let me share something with you too.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.380
I too intend to win.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.090
Let it be.

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:14.230
Kill me.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:19.280
Please kill me.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.620
I beg you.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.940
This time I will make sure.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.070
Girl...

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.080
There is no value in shielding that life.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.080
If you will not move,

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:16.670
you must be content to die by having your head crushed
along with that man's upper body.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:20.590
Please do so. It's over.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.430
Without this man,

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:26.560
it will be utterly impossible to continue my journey.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:30.770
However, I would ask one mercy of you.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:35.110
The one I originally swore vengeance on was Kagehisa
Anotsu alone.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.980
My soul's very wish is to see the end

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.820
of the Itto-ryu.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:45.580
Once I have seen Kagehisa Anotsu fall, I will gladly take
my own life.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:49.500
-Until then, please--!
-Oh daughter of bravery,

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:54.040
your words have reason at first glance,

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:58.920
but to my eyes you appear to be desperately buying time.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:02.590
-Do I?
-Yes, you do.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.480
That would work if he were alive.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:17.980
But to survive in this sorry state,
he would have to be a starfish.

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:20.190
Mr. Manji

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.530
was my bodyguard,

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.410
my big brother, and my father.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.910
He's someone who taught me many things
on my journey.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:34.080
Someone who would stand up to whoever it was
for my sake, without fail.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:36.920
So for this to befall him...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:42.340
I'm the one who let him die. It was me.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:48.140
Mr. Manji suffered pain in my stead,

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.100
died in my stead.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.230
So...

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:56.230
Now that he's dead, I too...

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.730
must see the end.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.390
That monster...

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.360
Whoa, ow!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.700
Hyaku! That won't work on this woman.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:49.870
Just look at us.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.240
Aren't you incapacitated?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:54.160
The wounded should pull back.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.500
Is your bow one that has not missed its mark in the past?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.800
If it's not,

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.880
then it is a bow I can most certainly dodge.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.430
You making light of me?

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:11.680
Hyaku, you and I are both Mugai-ryu.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.850
The baby inside you is not.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:17.890
Don't drag it into this. That's what I swore when I chose
to raise it.

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:20.980
Don't give me that crap, baldy!

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.360
How many times have you thrust yourself into
double KO situations, baldy?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.610
-If that's how you really feel, then--
-Woman.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:30.490
That blonde one is no match for you.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.410
Nor are we, plainly.

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:36.120
In other words, there is no one left here
who can stop you.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.250
That being the case, I beseech you.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.540
Please spare us.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.550
If you see fit.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.890
You have killed countless Itto-ryu,

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:53.390
and now you beg for life?

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.270
How selfish.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.650
A pregnant woman

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.570
should not throw herself down a cliff to get here.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.110
Do take care.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.150
For this strong one's sake as well.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.780
If you people are no longer a threat to Kagehisa Anotsu,

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.330
I will take my leave.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:32.340
I have been uplifted, by none other than you...
Someone who has lost everything.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.010
Never in my life have I so strongly felt the urge to live.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:40.190
I'm coming, Kagehisa.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.950
How absurd.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.370
They're dead.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.040
The devil...

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.710
The devil has gone.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.710
Once the girl's business is dealt with,

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.970
I will leave her to Lord Habaki.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.260
The arm wrap...

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:48.710
It can't be!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:51.380
Back then...?!

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.770
I got y--!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.240
It...It really was...

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.610
her blood.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.260
She swore...

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:37.050
she would never risk her life for me again...

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.510
Yet here we are, again.

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:45.140
Hey, you ever seen something like that?

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.560
An idiot who'd throw their life away

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:51.110
to plead for the life of their bodyguard?

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:57.240
Who you're about to lose to isn't me.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.910
It's that idiot.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:15.380
How?

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.760
How can you handle that arm with such ease?

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.640
This isn't something to boast about, but

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:26.430
I'm pretty much handicapped over here.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.940
Where? Where is he?

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.280
Good night.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.110
It's a miracle

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:19.900
the both of us are still alive, Mister Habaki.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.120
This fight is losing its meaning...
We must end this at once.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:35.460
This very memory must be branded in our minds.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.630
We must engrave it.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.840
Even if it steals the light away.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.430
If I am of the Shogunate,

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.430
I must vanquish evil until the end of time!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.730
The cost was a steep one,

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:02.410
but all is well. Now the life will be choked from you!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.920
This is bad. How far did we fall?

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.350
Recall it, his presence.

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.640
His breath!

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.650
Before you. Kagehisa Anotsu is before you!

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.940
He is already awake, father!

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:40.400
Ryo?

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:44.570
Stand down, girl.
or do you want the snow to be covered with your blood.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.030
Try it!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.040
You would speak like that before my blinded father?

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.870
Praise is sung of your gallantry and fair fighting,

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.920
but your true heart now reveals itself!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:57.840
What is this childishness? We are in the midst of combat.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.710
-Have you not deduced this?
-Oh, that's right.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.260
And it was your honor that stole my father's right eye.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.470
But the left eye was different.

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:09.140
So I will now destroy your left eye,

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:10.600
and even the field.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:15.520
Father?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.520
I'm sorry.

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:21.990
My daughter has hindered us.

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:25.450
No, what's truly troublesome

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:30.370
is that the daughter will have to see the father
vanquished before her.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.160
You speak as if

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:37.500
the only one to be vanquished here today will be me.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:42.510
For all that is good, Father... Please withdraw!

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:43.800
For all his talk,

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:47.840
that man is eyeing you like a cat does wounded prey!

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.600
He's looking for an opening to--!

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:52.850
On the matter of archers aboard a ship,

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.230
as long as they don't try to steal the ship,

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:57.690
-if they swear to not loose another arrow--
-Shut up!

00:21:57.770 --> 00:21:59.770
I won't be deceived. I won't be deceived!

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:02.480
Not when you smell of gunpowder.

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:06.150
Father, please hear me out!

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.360
Please!

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:10.320
Father... Father, please!

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.620
Kagehisa...

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:54.800
ACT TWENTY THREE - 100 SPECTACULAR DANCES
